{"schemaVersion":1,"durationMinutes":30,"audioUrl":"","parts":[{"id":"en-c17-t3-l-p1","title":"Part 1","part_number":1,"passage_text":"","audio_url":"https://ielts-listening-audio.engnovatemedia.com/13670-cambridge-ielts-17-academic-listening-3-audio-1.mp3","question_groups":[{"id":"en-c17-t3-l-g1-0","type":"source_html","ieltsQuestionType":"note_completion","instructions":"","sourceHeading":"Questions 1-10","sourceHtml":"<div class=\"source-question-section-content\"><div class=\"source-section-content-wrapper\"><p><em>Complete the notes below.</em></p><p><em>Write&nbsp;<strong>ONE WORD AND/OR A NUMBER</strong>&nbsp;for each answer.</em></p><p class=\"source-transcript-subhead\"><strong><strong>Advice on surfing holidays</strong></strong></p><p><strong>Jack’s advice</strong></p><ul><li>Recommends surfing for <span class=\"source-question-item\"><strong class=\"source-question-number\">1</strong><span data-luma-question=\"en-c17-t3-l-q1\" data-luma-kind=\"text\"></span></span>&nbsp;holidays in the summer</li><li>Need to be quite <span class=\"source-question-item\"><strong class=\"source-question-number\">2</strong><span data-luma-question=\"en-c17-t3-l-q2\" data-luma-kind=\"text\"></span></span></li></ul><p><strong>Irish surfing locations</strong></p><ul><li>County Clare</li></ul><p>–&nbsp; Lahinch has some good quality <span class=\"source-question-item\"><strong class=\"source-question-number\">3</strong><span data-luma-question=\"en-c17-t3-l-q3\" data-luma-kind=\"text\"></span></span>&nbsp;and surf schools</p><p>–&nbsp; There are famous cliffs nearby</p><ul><li>County Mayo</li></ul><p>–&nbsp; Good surf school at <span class=\"source-question-item\"><strong class=\"source-question-number\">4</strong><span data-luma-question=\"en-c17-t3-l-q4\" data-luma-kind=\"text\"></span></span>&nbsp;beach</p><p>–&nbsp; Surf camp lasts for one <span class=\"source-question-item\"><strong class=\"source-question-number\">5</strong><span data-luma-question=\"en-c17-t3-l-q5\" data-luma-kind=\"text\"></span></span></p><p>–&nbsp; Can also explore the local <span class=\"source-question-item\"><strong class=\"source-question-number\">6</strong><span data-luma-question=\"en-c17-t3-l-q6\" data-luma-kind=\"text\"></span></span>&nbsp;by kayak</p><p><strong>Weather</strong></p><ul><li>Best month to go: <span class=\"source-question-item\"><strong class=\"source-question-number\">7</strong><span data-luma-question=\"en-c17-t3-l-q7\" data-luma-kind=\"text\"></span></span></li><li>Average temperature in summer: approx. <span class=\"source-question-item\"><strong class=\"source-question-number\">8</strong><span data-luma-question=\"en-c17-t3-l-q8\" data-luma-kind=\"text\"></span></span> degrees</li></ul><p><strong>Costs</strong></p><ul><li>Equipment</li></ul><p>–&nbsp; Wetsuit and surfboard: <span class=\"source-question-item\"><strong class=\"source-question-number\">9</strong><span data-luma-question=\"en-c17-t3-l-q9\" data-luma-kind=\"text\"></span></span>&nbsp;euros per day</p><p>–&nbsp; Also advisable to hire <span class=\"source-question-item\"><strong class=\"source-question-number\">10</strong><span data-luma-question=\"en-c17-t3-l-q10\" data-luma-kind=\"text\"></span></span>&nbsp;for warmth</p></div></div><div class=\"source-questions\"><div class=\"source-question-item\"></div><div class=\"source-question-item\"></div><div class=\"source-question-item\"></div><div class=\"source-question-item\"></div><div class=\"source-question-item\"></div><div class=\"source-question-item\"></div><div class=\"source-question-item\"></div><div class=\"source-question-item\"></div><div class=\"source-question-item\"></div><div class=\"source-question-item\"></div></div>","sourceQuestionCount":10}],"audio_fallbacks":["https://engnovate.com/wp-content/uploads/2023/07/cambridge-ielts-17-academic-listening-3-audio-1.mp3"],"order_index":1},{"id":"en-c17-t3-l-p2","title":"Part 2","part_number":2,"passage_text":"","audio_url":"https://ielts-listening-audio.engnovat